\begin{slide}
CT I Kalman Filter Sequencing
\begin{itemize}
 \item Main .1 Hz Sequence:
	\begin{itemize}
		\item Extrapolate state vector and transition matrix to current time
		\item Perform covariance rate limiting
		\item Extrapolate covariance matrix to current time
		\item Process observations
		\begin{itemize}
			\item Gain computation included herein
		\end{itemize}
	\end{itemize}
\end{itemize} 
\end{slide}
